 will last for a long time. In addition, it is an accessory to show off your fashion sense and your social status.</p>\n\n                <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img alt=\"f2\" src=\"/storage/main/blog/post-5.jpg\"></p>\n\n                <p> </p>\n                ','published',0,NULL,1,'2025-05-18 01:30:49',NULL,'Verified business with valid documentation',NULL,'2026-06-29 01:30:51','2026-06-29 01:30:51',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(3,'Young Shop','ludwig31@example.net','+18033852723','520 Ryan Freeway','MY','Hawaii','Port Geovany',6,'main/stores/3.png',NULL,'main/stores/cover-3.png','Alias dignissimos expedita eius voluptas. Fuga ea illum praesentium voluptatibus aut omnis. Occaecati quas pariatur facilis. Incidunt earum sapiente autem eos ab adipisci. Voluptate quam molestiae deserunt quam minus. Ab voluptatem et error nesciunt excepturi in.','<p>I have seen many people underestimating the power of their wallets. To them, they are just a functional item they use to carry. As a result, they often end up with the wallets which are not really suitable for them.</p>\n\n                <p>You should pay more attention when you choose your wallets. There are a lot of them on the market with the different designs and styles. When you choose carefully, you would be able to buy a wallet that is catered to your needs. Not to mention that it will help to enhance your style significantly.</p>\n\n                <p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img alt=\"f4\" src=\"/storage/main/blog/post-1.jpg\"></p>\n\n                <p><br>\n                 </p>\n\n                <p><strong><em>For all of the reason above, here are 7 expert tips to help you pick up the right men’s wallet for you:</em></strong></p>\n\n                <h4><strong>Number 1: Choose A Neat Wallet</strong></h4>\n\n                <p>The wallet is an essential accessory that you should go simple. Simplicity is the best in this case. A simple and neat wallet with the plain color and even <stron